{"story_id":30344,"updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:20:55","headline_en":"Two Indian javelin throwers win medals in Japan despite Neeraj Chopra absence","headline_hi":"नीरज चोपड़ा की अनुपस्थिति के बावजूद जापान में दो भारतीय जैवलिन थ्रोअर ने पदक जीते","payload_en":{"story_id":30344,"headline":"Two Indian javelin throwers win medals in Japan despite Neeraj Chopra absence","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":30344,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-17T12:20:55","category":{"primary":["life"],"secondary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["javelin thrower Neeraj Chopra","Hangzhou Asian Games","Japan","Kishore Jena","Rohit Yadav","Yash Vir Singh","Yashvir Singh"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"India won two medals at the recent event despite the absence of Neeraj Chopra and Kishore Jena.","ids":[55556],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Indian javelin thrower Chopra's goal is to raise his performance level again in the next season.","ids":[55344],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"He sustained an ankle ligament tear during training in August.","ids":[55345],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Yash Vir Singh and Rohit Yadav won silver and bronze medals respectively in men's javelin at the 2026 Asian Games.","ids":[55552],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Chopra is focused on preparing for the 2028 Olympics.","ids":[55550],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Indian javelin thrower Chopra previously secured a gold and Kishore Jena secured a silver at the 2023 Hangzhou Asian Games.","ids":[55358],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"He missed the 2026 Asian Games in Japan.","ids":[55544],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"He spoke about his recovery during the launch of the 2026 Audi Q3 in Mumbai.","ids":[55348],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Chopra praised young Indian javelin throwers.","ids":[55548],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Yashvir Singh recorded his best throw of 85.72 meters.","ids":[55364],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Rohit Yadav recorded his best throw of 84.35 meters.","ids":[55365],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"Indian javelin thrower Chopra discussed the national team's performance at the 2026 Asian Games and stated that he is currently working on a comeback following an injury.","ids":[55340,55339],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"\"My focus now is on staging a strong, solid comeback next year and delivering the kind of performance Iâve been aiming for,\" Indian javelin thrower Chopra said, adding that not only Yashvir, but Rohit also performed exceptionally well at Asian Games 2026.","ids":[55338,55341],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"\"The emergence of new, young athletes is a very positive sign for India,\" Indian javelin thrower Chopra said.","ids":[55342],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"He advised young athletes to take care of their health and enjoy the sport.","ids":[55559,55560],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Chopra wants to make a strong comeback in 2027.","ids":[55361],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"\"The emergence of these new, young athletes shows that India has a shortage of talent,\" Neeraj said, wishing young athletes the best for the future and advising them to stay injury-free.","ids":[55357,55366,55368],"class":"single","sources":[1]}]],"section_keys":["news","who","who","who","journey","journey","journey","words","words","words"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.aajtak.in/sports/cricket/story/neeraj-chopra-comeback-2027-ankle-injury-recovery-update-tspok-dskc-2673280-2026-10-17","outlet":"Aaj Tak","title":"नीरज चोपड़ा फिर काटेंगे गदर! चोट से उबर रहे स्टार का बड़ा ऐलान","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"ur